{"input": "直接教我一个小知识点：向量检索中，相似度高为什么不保证答案正确？只讲这个知识点，简短解释后出一道让我用自己的话复述的检查题。讲稳定原理，不需要网页搜索。", "seconds": 10.67, "status": "completed", "error": null, "intent": {"conversation_kind": "ordinary", "clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "reply_feedback": "none", "reply_purpose": "none", "knowledge_card_status": false, "status_context": null, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "resource_boundary": "none", "resource_learning_request": "", "learning_reply_sentence_limit": null, "intents": ["goal"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "向量检索中相似度高不保证答案正确", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": "source_learning", "scope": "learning", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户明确要求直接教一个小知识点、简短解释后出一道复述检查题，主题与用途都已明确，无需澄清，也不需要联网核验。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": true, "direct_teaching": true, "answer_only": false, "is_jd": false, "material_focus": "none", "jd_request": "none", "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": "source_learning", "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": ["向量检索", "相似度与答案正确性"], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "run_state": {"run_id": "8c0e62ce-af56-4e42-8fe9-e1d6606356f5", "revision": 1, "task_id": "63099ee3-51f1-436d-911b-618a83e066ea", "lifecycle_revision": 0, "dialogue_only": null, "knowledge_status_reply": null, "execution_complete": true, "capture_scope_update": null, "evaluated_binding": null, "verified_concepts": null, "capture_quotes": null, "capture_feedback_quotes": null}, "session_state": {"active_task_id": "63099ee3-51f1-436d-911b-618a83e066ea", "lifecycle_revision": 0, "draft_id": null, "draft_version": null}, "task_states": [{"task_id": "63099ee3-51f1-436d-911b-618a83e066ea", "mode": "source_learning", "stage": "teaching", "status": "awaiting_user", "understanding": "unknown", "requires_mastery": false, "memory_invalidated": false, "learning_plan": {"id": "63099ee3-51f1-436d-911b-618a83e066ea", "version": 1, "goal": "向量检索中相似度高不保证答案正确", "steps": [{"id": "f85c699f-9ffc-47f3-8244-78d65984f956", "state": "explained", "understanding": "unknown", "message_ids": ["3d268f06-9efb-4554-8840-51c20c457a44"], "completion_condition": "能说出相似度比较的是向量方向/语义接近程度。", "title": "理解相似度衡量的是语义接近，而非事实正确"}, {"id": "98f70bae-5aa1-41d8-b3dc-c6ac6669f2e1", "state": "pending", "understanding": "unknown", "message_ids": [], "completion_condition": "能指出向量中不携带事实真伪与时效信息，正反表述可能同样高分。", "title": "理解为什么高分召回仍可能是错误或过时内容"}, {"id": "89d01ae8-982a-48d1-b1bd-57bf5f5037aa", "state": "pending", "understanding": "unknown", "message_ids": [], "completion_condition": "能用自拟例子向外行解释，并提到需要额外核验来保证正确性。", "title": "能用自己的话向外行解释并举例"}], "current_step_id": "f85c699f-9ffc-47f3-8244-78d65984f956", "success_check": "能独立说明相似度是主题接近的代理指标，并用一个自拟例子解释高分不等于正确答案，同时指出正确性需要靠后续核验环节保障。"}}], "coach_calls": [{"node": "lesson", "schema": "TeachingConversationOutput", "task_id": "63099ee3-51f1-436d-911b-618a83e066ea", "task_status": "accepted", "task_stage": "accepted", "capture_candidates": [], "update_instruction_present": false, "returned_capture_update": null, "returned_learning_concepts": ["向量相似度", "语义接近"]}], "replies": ["## 一句话先说清\n\n向量检索里的“相似度高”，指的是**两段文字的向量方向接近**，也就是它们在模型眼里“说的是同一类东西”；它衡量的是**像不像**，不是**对不对**。所以一段和问题高度贴近的文字，可能依然是一句错的、过时的或答非所问的话。\n\n## 直观例子\n\n假设你问“感冒能吃抗生素吗”。库里有一句“感冒吃抗生素好得快”——这句话从主题、用词到句式都跟你的问题高度贴合，向量相似度会很高；但它其实是错的建议。检索器只负责把“最像”的句子捞出来，不负责判断它对不对。\n\n## 为什么\n\n- **相似度是“主题接近”的代理指标**：向量由模型把语义压成一组数字，接近只说明语义分布相近。\n- **它没有事实通道**：向量里不携带“这条信息是否经得起医学/法律/时效检验”的标记。\n- **它不区分正反**：一句正确的“感冒不该吃抗生素”和一句错误的“感冒该吃抗生素”，主题词几乎一样，相似度都可能很高。\n- **它不感知时效与适用条件**：一条旧结论只要表述模式相近，也会被高分召回，检索阶段看不到“已经过时”。\n\n一句话：**检索负责“找得到、找得准”，正确性要由后续的核验环节（查权威来源、交叉比对、看日期与适用范围）来兜。**\n\n---\n\n下面这道题不是考术语背记，是想听听你怎么用自己的话把它讲出来。\n\n---\n\n### 想一想\n\n请用你自己的话，向一个没学过检索的朋友解释：为什么向量相似度高，并不能保证检索到的答案是对的？可以举一个你自己想的例子。"], "offers": [], "model_calls": 3, "model_usage": [{"id": "9e479f72-d7d1-4765-baf0-264dc5f71bab", "budget_id": "cf053de3-821f-43ce-80cd-ed4d6ebb66ce", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "intent", "model": "deepseek-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 27962, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "753205fb-7e60-486e-89bb-5e0f6493bea8", "input_tokens": 12701, "output_tokens": 368, "total_tokens": 13069, "cached_input_tokens": 12544, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}, {"id": "77fc1bb4-f272-4510-ae8f-ddd3b7962c3b", "budget_id": "cf053de3-821f-43ce-80cd-ed4d6ebb66ce", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "teaching_preparation", "model": "deepseek-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 1785, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "67593360-3c79-435c-9411-307e0f71a08b", "input_tokens": 914, "output_tokens": 148, "total_tokens": 1062, "cached_input_tokens": 768, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}, {"id": "00f831a7-40b3-4fcb-91b8-d3dffa31ec44", "budget_id": "cf053de3-821f-43ce-80cd-ed4d6ebb66ce", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "lesson", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 11190, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "1ad1f64b-e095-4683-8c28-8cfe804c8563", "input_tokens": 5329, "output_tokens": 701, "total_tokens": 6030, "cached_input_tokens": 4480, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}], "errors": []}
